{"product_id":"la-belle-sauvage-the-book-of-dust-volume-one-book-of-dust-series","title":"La Belle Sauvage: The Book of Dust Volume One (Book of Dust Series)","description":"\u003cp\u003eEleven-year-old Malcolm Polstead and his dæmon, Asta, live with his parents at the Trout Inn near Oxford. Across the River Thames (which Malcolm navigates often using his beloved canoe, a boat by the name of La Belle Sauvage) is the Godstow Priory where the nuns live. Malcolm learns they have a guest with them; a baby by the name of Lyra Belacqua . . .\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 162 x 240\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Philip Pullman\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780385604413\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 546\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45647697936537,"sku":"16RD-39780385604413","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/688e55d654119_La_Belle_Sauvage-_The_Book_of_Dust_Volume_One__Book_of_Dust_Series__Philip_Pullman.jpg?v=1755351452","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/la-belle-sauvage-the-book-of-dust-volume-one-book-of-dust-series","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}